window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A genius vampire named Sinclair creates an alternate world where vampires can experience a traditional human life of love, marriage, and children. Sixteen-year-old Gabriel is his beta tester and volunteers to fall in love with a coffee shop girl. But when the pain of love becomes overwhelming, Gabriel wonders about his decision. \"It's too real,\" he tells Sinclair. \"You made it too real.\"</p>"; 
